        </button> <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAMLCwgAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" alt="Figure 6" data-zoomable="true" data-src="https://static.cambridge.org/binary/version/id/urn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20250403052859468-0628:S0730938425000024:S0730938425000024_tab3.png" data-enlarged-image="https://static.cambridge.org/binary/version/id/urn:cambridge.org:id:binary:20250403052859468-0628:S0730938425000024:S0730938425000024_tab3.png" class="graphic" data-v-0cf2584c></div> <div data-v-0cf2584c><div class="caption" data-v-0cf2584c><p data-v-0cf2584c><span class="label" data-v-0cf2584c>Table 3.</span> <span data-v-0cf2584c><span class="p">Logit Models’ Fitness for Political View (Republican = 1)</span></span></p></div> </div></div> <!----></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div id="metrics-tab" publication-date="28 March 2025" class="metrics tab-pane" data-v-c41a0c86><div class="app-loader" data-v-c41a0c86></div></div></div></div> <!----></div> <div role="complementary" aria-label="article tools" class="column__main__right" data-v-e082f832><div class="access-block row access-status" data-v-5fad35b8 data-v-e082f832><span class="has-access" data-v-5fad35b8><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="" class="app-icon access" data-v-d2c09870 data-v-5fad35b8> <span class="sr-only" data-v-5fad35b8>You have </span>
